    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a content strategist for a creator. From today's signals, pick up to {{ $json.max_ideas }} video ideas that genuinely fit the niche. Skip trends that do not fit; it is fine to return fewer ideas. Never invent facts about a trend; only use what the signals say.\n\nNiche: {{ $json.niche }}\nAudience: {{ $json.audience }}\n\nTrending searches ({{ $json.geo }}):\n{{ $json.trends_text || 'none' }}\n\nNew uploads from channels I watch (last {{ $json.lookback_hours }} hours):\n{{ $json.competitor_text || 'none' }}\n\nFor each idea: topic (a specific video title), hook (first line spoken, under 15 words), format (short or long), angle (what makes my take different), why_now (one line citing the signal), source (which signal it came from), relevance 1-10 for my niche and audience, urgency (today, this week or evergreen).",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "ed651027-a1aa-5fbc-b78f-9f9a9a4c1ee6",
      "name": "Pick video ideas",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1700,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
